# Build output of a local `npm run build`, copied there by a dev run. The image
# gets the SPA from the frontend stage (Dockerfile line 32); without this, the
# `COPY backend/ ./` above would drag stale chunks in and the later COPY merges
# on top without removing them, shipping months-old assets in the image.
